.TH WB\-REVISION 1 "" "watchbill"
.SH NAME
wb\-revision \- print the version, the revision and its manifest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBwb\fR revision
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print the version of the package, the hash of its revision and the manifest: the hash of every file the revision holds.
.PP
It writes nothing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
It is printed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wb (1) ,
.BR wb\-check (1) ,
.BR wb\-upgrade (1)
